#: search2:search2_EC22BA4B_7D57_4ACF_A0BB_BEC27F9ADBDA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 267ec564a337cc786e71fff800ef852cc45b3c1b013df1e717c265d018a7d5e3
