msgctxt "search2:search2_EC22BA4B_7D57_4ACF_A0BB_BEC27F9ADBDA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I don’t know how I got here, but I’m sitting in a rocking chair, hunched forward."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫いつの間にか、⟪k:1⟫私はロッキングチェアーに腰かけ、⟪k:2⟫項垂れていた。"

#: search2:search2_7BF9D9B0_0E96_41DE_91C3_9EE1CDFECB95
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 38de95349720dba618f82d6422f43564b6b619715e8a166e0dceaf0e0704dbdf
#. default-sha256: 60e1e2fcb019ad77b8b4c2559ffb23447e7d29a216ce4535aa93cc4f88a93e2c
msgctxt "search2:search2_7BF9D9B0_0E96_41DE_91C3_9EE1CDFECB95"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫A suffocating odor hangs over the room.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫What ⟪k:3⟫is⟪k:4⟫ this?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫噎せかえる程の臭気――、⟪k:1⟫これは一体……なんだ？"

#: search2:search2_D20D6053_076D_4F80_B267_25DDC33180BA
