#: search2:search2_0218F14E_C691_4FF2_A327_1BFACD1E65E2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c2030153ea3fd32023100135364184afb1c0d81f303ef90f8a0e84794532014a
