#: search2:search2_B20FCCAD_5D49_4025_8C07_D1FD60D50923
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4df4aa4dabfdf5bdf1e27fe3954761001a543d59ce200687d82d0026f90a8ede
#. default-sha256: 396e7a4478d3b2e5e9b67c64ae143b9ac4882e176fa75e7d48abf0e4247c70fb
msgctxt "search2:search2_B20FCCAD_5D49_4025_8C07_D1FD60D50923"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Are you seeing this... ⟪k:1⟫this same twisted nightmare as me...?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫君も……、⟪k:1⟫今……、⟪k:2⟫この歪んだ光景を目にしているのだろうか……。"

#: search2:search2_CFAAF7D4_A140_4C00_8D5E_8940E170B349
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7c74fd8b9b2780a3efb9e42f707f14c64a157ea902c97074fc0dbdf5eed442b7
#. default-sha256: b9ef225aadc095505095e6d11ea438102d2f49e8100814c9e6fa175739e2af6b
msgctxt "search2:search2_CFAAF7D4_A140_4C00_8D5E_8940E170B349"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫An image of her floating alone in a vast sea of blood flashes through my mind. ⟪k:1⟫That "
"vision kicks me into motion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫脳裏に浮かぶのは、⟪k:1⟫この血の海で置き去りにされた彼女の姿だった。⟪k:2⟫その映像が――私の身体"
"を動かす、⟪k:3⟫きっかけとなった。"

#: search2:search2_33374CBE_24F0_4A09_9138_61414EFC8719
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 11478f2390e3db15d8b6fac4e54d39b54c8aac4ac34fdb4a9ae904450a59908e
#. default-sha256: f0030fe6e86c056cd264e443b1e4beb40be04ebd832e8e41d5f230ad32904927
msgctxt "search2:search2_33374CBE_24F0_4A09_9138_61414EFC8719"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I begin walking—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫or, more accurately, dragging my heavy feet forward. ⟪k:3⟫The "
"constant splashing of blood against my ankles grates at my already taut nerves."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫重い身体を引きずるようにして、⟪k:1⟫歩き出す。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫足首を濡らし続ける血液の海が、⟪k:4⟫煩"
"わしい……。"

#: search2:search2_A08671D4_1A35_4F99_BDAF_68240B8127C8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2f83d6c7b608c1b82f481a370d89c63d2db161f7a6af70219babc7a31a9e9581
#. default-sha256: d00481e059ea5c8b6a9018de645be38a5bfdf4be6c5581e0fef224a56492c8eb
msgctxt "search2:search2_A08671D4_1A35_4F99_BDAF_68240B8127C8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Morgana told me to find my way to her, and I can think of only one place she would be."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫モルガーナは、⟪k:1⟫「私のもとまで来い」と、⟪k:2⟫言っていた。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫……私が知るモルガーナの"
"居場所は、⟪k:5⟫ひとつしかない。"

#: search2:search2_64DDCD57_C4DD_424C_96BE_39A865E23414
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2d6f2853baa663da78d06b41e7ac2e2e1fea22a747a7908648652dfc86fba958
#. default-sha256: b6f77e6f102287071f214fe816922207ea95d5fb91debc9b8e76628a062586b7
msgctxt "search2:search2_64DDCD57_C4DD_424C_96BE_39A865E23414"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She and Giselle must be there."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫それならきっと……、⟪k:1⟫そこに、⟪k:2⟫モルガーナとジゼルがいるはずだ。"

#: search2:search2_86126E8C_87B5_48EE_8C24_03057F9C1CC3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e43ea93b39f003b1cd3d2e8f0efa76de8f9de09e795621faec15583eb62f53ac
#. default-sha256: 41e748dc81bcbe067ab37ae382db157525f4da1beb9ff139272b5d92a29a9f9c
msgctxt "search2:search2_86126E8C_87B5_48EE_8C24_03057F9C1CC3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The stained-glass window is splattered with blood too.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It creates trails like "
"streams of tears running down the archangel’s face."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫大天使のステンドグラスも、⟪k:1⟫血に染まっていた。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫ガラスを伝う赤々とした液体は、"
"⟪k:4⟫涙のようにも見える。"

#: search2:search2_6C8B5A06_678D_494C_8D93_391585FFF537
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e56d38355a86289564103e81776a5eaa4d148fc040238810cba0dafe7e9d7270
